.TH GRID_SCROLL_BY 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_scroll_by \- Scroll the window by rows (negative is up), clamped to 0..grid_max_scroll
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_scroll_by(Grid *g, int rows);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scroll the window by rows (negative is up), clamped to 0..grid_max_scroll. The cursor does not move, so it may leave the window; the next cursor move brings it back.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_max_scroll (3),
.BR grid_move (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
